and trying to appeal to
people they don't even know.

00:08:33.016 --> 00:08:35.124
And you have to just make yourself happy.

00:08:35.124 --> 00:08:38.041
(triumphant music)

00:09:24.242 --> 00:09:25.451
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:09:25.451 --> 00:09:28.818
I made this video because
Generation Y asked me to.

00:09:28.818 --> 00:09:30.280
If there's someone
you'd like me to profile

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.578
in our future Top Ten,

00:09:31.578 --> 00:09:33.685
please check out the link
down in the description below

00:09:33.685 --> 00:09:37.055
and you can cast your vote
on who we should do next.

00:09:37.055 --> 00:09:39.242
I also want to give a quick
shout out to Vijay Raj.

00:09:39.242 --> 00:09:40.862
Vijay, thank you so much for picking up

00:09:40.862 --> 00:09:42.624
a copy of my book, Your One Word,

00:09:42.624 --> 00:09:44.394
and posting multiple videos

00:09:44.394 --> 00:09:46.171
on your YouTube channel about it.

00:09:46.171 --> 00:09:48.032
I really, really, really
appreciate the support.

00:09:48.032 --> 00:09:50.023
And I'm so glad that you enjoyed the book.

00:09:50.023 --> 00:09:52.067
- Your mindset for greatness
leads to your one word,

00:09:52.067 --> 00:09:54.530
so that you're standing
for something important.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.273
- Thank you guys, again, for watching.

00:09:56.273 --> 00:09:57.968
I believe in you.

00:09:57.968 --> 00:09:59.429
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:09:59.429 --> 00:10:00.567
and whatever your one word is.

00:10:00.567 --> 00:10:01.996
Much love.

00:10:01.996 --> 00:10:02.930
I'll see you soon.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.597
(sound effects)

00:10:09.428 --> 00:10:11.338
I think success for me is longevity.

00:10:11.338 --> 00:10:14.379
Like, I don't want this
to be around this year

00:10:14.379 --> 00:10:15.864
and no one knows about it in five years.

00:10:15.864 --> 00:10:17.750
Like I would like this to be a brand

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.367
that really grows roots

00:10:19.367 --> 00:10:21.286
and is here for like
years and years to come.

00:10:21.286 --> 00:10:22.303
And again, who knows?

00:10:22.303 --> 00:10:24.494
Good American is a name
that could venture off

00:10:24.494 --> 00:10:27.012
to men or children or whatever.

00:10:27.012 --> 00:10:28.957
But I'm just excited
to see where that goes.

00:10:28.957 --> 00:10:31.230
And it's absolutely outrageous

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.461
the positive reaction we've gotten.

00:10:33.461 --> 00:10:36.407
And it's so, it just makes me like

00:10:36.407 --> 00:10:38.772
so proud and excited and like, it's...

00:10:38.772 --> 00:10:39.704
I'm just so happy.

00:10:39.704 --> 00:10:40.537
But it is like I'm dreaming.

00:10:40.537 --> 00:10:43.067
So I'm excited just to
baby this a little bit,

00:10:43.067 --> 00:10:44.558
and then see where it goes.

00:10:44.558 --> 00:10:45.719
(sound effects)

